<title>ITALY: Olivetti's Tecnost sells unit.</title>
<headline>Olivetti's Tecnost sells unit.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tecnost, an offshoot of Olivetti, sold its Dating Spa unit to Honeywell Spa, the Italian subsidiary of the Honeywell group for 24 billion lire.</p>
<p>Olivetti said in a statement Tecnost had made a capital gain of seven billion lire on the sale of Dating, which specialises in access control systems, building automation and security systems.</p>
<p>Dating, acquired in 1986, had turnover of 47 billion lire in 1996, making it the Italian market leader in the sector.</p>
<p>Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
